comment.narrative:
"The target for Y1 was 20

We have set our  targets for year 1 based on activities already being carried out and results achieved recently by F4A partners and Oxfam Br.
- 9 times in which human rights defenders, when approached by violating agents or police, discreetly recorded audio or video, with the aim of recording the moment and creating evidence in their favor;
- 3 times in which human rights defenders refused to attend the Police Station or to meetings with authorities without the presence of their lawyers or representatives of the CPT;
- 3 times in which human rights defenders prevented the enforcement of judicial decisions, because they are aware of the excesses in these decisions and in the execution of them;
- There were also other timeswhen human rights advocates created autonomous community safety strategies as a way to manage risks, such as holding vigils at the threatened farmer's house or plantation area that the violating agent claimed he would destroy."
